    "steam_appid": 2364360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364360/extras/7fe989006b7aeb9879a78b2c49a99f4d.avif?t=1683022905\" /></span><br><br><br><br>Start the war now and build buildings for your nation! <br>The goal is to best develop your territory and make the most beautiful kingdom!<br><br>Build and defend your territory with your allies! Find yourself in the middle of a block war where the goal is to prove to the other nations that you have a better creativity! <br><br>Play all the nations of the world with your friends and take over the whole map!<br>Be careful with your buildings because war can break out at any time and everything you've built can disappear if you don't defend yourself!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364360/extras/7fe989006b7aeb9879a78b2c49a99f4d.avif?t=1683022905\" /></span><br><br><br><br>Start the war now and build buildings for your nation! <br>The goal is to best develop your territory and make the most beautiful kingdom!<br><br>Build and defend your territory with your allies! Find yourself in the middle of a block war where the goal is to prove to the other nations that you have a better creativity! <br><br>Play all the nations of the world with your friends and take over the whole map!<br>Be careful with your buildings because war can break out at any time and everything you've built can disappear if you don't defend yourself!",
    "short_description": "A game inspired by r/place but adapted as a 3D MMO. Build the best constructions for your nation in a gigantic map that can accommodate thousands of constructions and hundreds of players. Take control of territory and expand to conquer the entire map!",
